## Como usar este documento

- **Audience**: legal/compliance gate + dev lead deciding which deps
  can enter the consumer's `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt`.
- **Next action**: read §3 (blocking licenses) before approving any
  port; AGPL/SSPL/proprietary items need explicit sign-off.
- **Quando re-verificar**: a cada release maior do sistema-alvo, ou
  quando `extract/dependencies.md` mudar.

