## 7. Audit commands reference

```bash
# Python
pip install pip-licenses
pip-licenses --format=markdown --with-authors --with-urls > licenses.md

# Go
go install github.com/google/go-licenses@latest
go-licenses csv ./... > licenses.csv

# JS / TS
pnpm ls --depth=Infinity --json | jq -r '.[] | "\(.name)@\(.version) \(.license // "UNKNOWN")"'

# Generic SPDX compliance
pip install reuse
reuse lint --root /path/to/repo

# Full audit tree (detect transitive contamination)
go mod graph | go-licenses check
pip install pip-licenses && pip-licenses --with-system
```

